  unitNumber: 71
  description: A human-like plant native to deep forests where the sun can't reach.
    They sleep as they grow in the earth. If pulled from the ground they will become
    violent and attack whoever disturbed them. They are dangerous when carelessly
    touched as their scream can shake a person's very soul. However, it could just
    be that they're just a bit crazy as they are sometimes friendly.
